        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, nuclear, at power plant
Details on the two components average PWR and average BWR can be found in the respective mudules.;
UUID: f7654254-5dba-3302-af6d-e7a74b01bebf
The module represents the Swiss nuclear mix (electricity delivered in the period 1995 - 1999) of 55% PWR and 45% BWR.
Location: Swiss data of one specific PWR and one specific BWR for the mix.
Technology: Standard technology for commercial operation.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Energy statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f7654254-5dba-3302-af6d-e7a74b01bebf.xml</text>
